    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>The Deetz on Delia Deetz</h3><p>The crystal-loving, self-help guru Delia Deetz is step-mom to Lydia Deetz (played by Hannah Nordberg). For a limited period only - until 2 November - Delia is played by four-time Olivier Award nominated <strong>Summer Strallen. </strong>From 3 November, <strong>Aimie Atkinson </strong>returns to the role, direct from her Broadway debut in <em>SIX the Musical. </em></p>
    </div>
    

                
            
        </div>
        

        

        


    </div>

